OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome bright spells to start the
OL,7,Fevening but thickening cloud heralding
OL,8,Fperiods of rain that reach the western
OL,9,Fcoasts and Isles late evening, before
OL,10,Ffollowing to all overnight with
OL,11,Fheavier outbreaks in west and
OL,12,Fstrengthening winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with rain
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times early in west.
OL,16,FRain progressively more patchy through
OL,17,Fmorning, leading to a mainly dry
OL,18,Fafternoon with some brighter spells in
OL,19,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
