OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fmainly dry with light winds and sunny
OL,7,Fspells best in east. Monday wet and
OL,8,Foccasionally windy with the east in
OL,9,Fbest of shelter. Tuesday showery.
